  "api35_limit": "Fresh-profile key tests passed 4/4 and native scanner 3/3. Hardware-keyboard credential UI uses the real SystemUI lockPassword/pinEntry text field; selectors were corrected and a real synthetic PIN manually confirmed vault access. Final selected UI run passed updater 4/4 and scanner import 1/1 but failed phone wake 1/1 (Locked, busy=false, no error). Permission denial/import cancellation passed separately 1/1. Do not treat this as full API35 unlock acceptance.",
