    "Initial API26/API35 provisioning driver accepted only newer success wording; Pin set to was a successful setup. Corrected and rerun.",
    "First password-wait implementation used package-private UIAutomator Searchable and failed compilation; replaced with a bounded public-API polling loop.",
    "Focused search tests exposed stale accessibility nodes, asynchronous conditional controls and below-viewport Search Position. Failed diagnostics are retained locally.",
    "A shell chain continued a full attempt after a failed focused precheck; that attempt was preserved and stopped after reproducing the phone-wake bug. Subsequent drivers stop on failed prerequisites.",
    "API26 reused-profile APK installation failed before tests: Android package service unavailable. A new profile control connection failed outside the recommended emulator port range. The same clean profile on standard port5584 passed both new UI checks; no test failures were reclassified as passes.",
    "Initial clean API35 key setup passed but UI tests expected digit buttons instead of its hardware-keyboard PIN field. Corrected selectors exposed a separate real phone-wake failure.",
    "Full API37 desktop command exited143 before buffered output was saved; actual AndroidJUnitRunner completion was recovered with its transcript/rotation limits preserved in full_app."
